Package: CellHet
Title: Analysis of Cell Heterogeneity in Single-Cell Data
Version: 0.0.1
Date: 2025-04-14
Authors@R: 
    person("Kai", "Guo", email = "guokai8@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A comprehensive toolkit for analyzing cell heterogeneity in single-cell RNA-seq data
    across multiple group comparisons. CellHet provides functions to analyze and visualize 
    differential gene expression, shared molecular signatures, pathway enrichment, and
    cell type heterogeneity in complex experimental designs. The package includes tools
    for quantifying the degree of heterogeneity in cell type responses and identifying 
    unique and shared molecular features that characterize different cell populations.
